 "remarks": "Discover the perfect blend of comfort, style, and convenience in this spacious, move-in-ready 2-bedroom townhouse offering generous closet space and two assigned garage parking spaces directly beneath the home. Freshly painted throughout, this beautifully updated residence features a newly remodeled kitchen, modern light fixtures, a new washer and dryer, and a brand-new energy-efficient HVAC system for year-round comfort. A Ring security camera system is also included. The well-maintained community boasts a newly paved driveway and professionally landscaped grounds, creating an inviting atmosphere.  Ideally located just minutes from The SoNo Collection, popular restaurants, vibrant nightlife, shopping, and entertainment, this home offers easy access to everything Norwalk has to offer. Commuters will appreciate the convenient proximity to I-95 and the Merritt Parkway, making travel throughout Fairfield County and beyond a breeze. Spacious, updated, and ideally located, this exceptional townhouse is ready for its next owner. A must-see!",
